                    "author": "Callum Merriman",
                    "order": "featured",
                    "description": "Learn about the planes flying above you! Magically turn your Yoto player into a Jet Plane Scanner that finds aeroplanes in the skies around you and teaches you all about them and the faraway destinations they are headed.\n\nDeveloper: Callum Merriman\nYoto Developers Challenge 2025 Winner\nThis free digital card was made by an Independent Developer and published on Yoto Space. Visit yoto.space/developers to find out more.\n\nNote — This is a connected card, which means it requires an internet connection on the Yoto player to play. This card uses AI to create a live and dynamic voice-over that updates based on your player's location.",
